{"unit_id":"kobenfang__ListForm#card-zh","repo":"kobenfang/ListForm","commit":"33b73a13d98e442220eb0e5420fe8b0916fab961","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"ListForm 是 DSH 结构化记录技能：入口注册随包提供的 SKILL.md，本地 Python 脚本读写 JSON。它支持创建记录类型、添加记录、按日期和字段查询、按字段汇总、列出及删除记录，也可随记录复制图片附件。适合在工作区保存自定义账目、日志或出货记录并查询汇总的用户。数据默认放在 workspace 的 memory/list-data 目录，可用 DSH_WORKSPACE 指定。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:49-85","scripts/list.py:13-26","scripts/list.py:42-124","scripts/list.py:126-164"]}
{"unit_id":"kobenfang__ListForm#card-en","repo":"kobenfang/ListForm","commit":"33b73a13d98e442220eb0e5420fe8b0916fab961","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"ListForm is a DSH structured-record skill. Its Python script creates record types, adds records with optional images, filters by date or fields, summarizes by field, lists types, and deletes records. JSON data defaults to workspace/memory/list-data; set DSH_WORKSPACE to change it.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:49-85","scripts/list.py:13-26","scripts/list.py:42-124","scripts/list.py:126-164"]}
