{"unit_id":"kobenfang__ListForm#feature-1","repo":"kobenfang/ListForm","commit":"33b73a13d98e442220eb0e5420fe8b0916fab961","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ListForm 的功能「自定义记录类型」：为新类型定义字段并创建空记录集。通过 new-type 子命令传入类型名和字段 JSON，结果保存为本地 JSON 文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["scripts/list.py:42-47","scripts/list.py:131-134"]}
{"unit_id":"kobenfang__ListForm#feature-2","repo":"kobenfang/ListForm","commit":"33b73a13d98e442220eb0e5420fe8b0916fab961","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ListForm 的功能「添加记录」：将字段数据追加到指定类型，生成记录 ID 和本地时间戳；可选复制图片到附件目录并关联到记录。通过 add 子命令提供数据 JSON 和可选图片路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["scripts/list.py:49-68","scripts/list.py:135-138"]}
{"unit_id":"kobenfang__ListForm#feature-3","repo":"kobenfang/ListForm","commit":"33b73a13d98e442220eb0e5420fe8b0916fab961","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ListForm 的功能「查询记录」：按起止日期筛选，也可用字段条件过滤；字符串条件按不区分大小写的子串匹配。通过 query 子命令输入类型和可选筛选项，输出匹配记录及数量。","source":"generated","evidence":["scripts/list.py:70-87","scripts/list.py:140-144"]}
{"unit_id":"kobenfang__ListForm#feature-4","repo":"kobenfang/ListForm","commit":"33b73a13d98e442220eb0e5420fe8b0916fab961","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ListForm 的功能「周期汇总」：在可选日期范围内按指定字段分组，统计记录数和 amount 合计；若类型定义含 amount 字段，还会给出总金额。通过 summary 子命令指定类型、日期和分组字段，输出 JSON 汇总。","source":"generated","evidence":["scripts/list.py:89-114","scripts/list.py:146-150"]}
{"unit_id":"kobenfang__ListForm#caveat-1","repo":"kobenfang/ListForm","commit":"33b73a13d98e442220eb0e5420fe8b0916fab961","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"ListForm 使用前须知：文档提到自动分类、定时提醒和文档归档，但已读脚本只实现记录增删查、汇总和可选图片复制；这些自动分类、提醒及文档处理行为没有在已读实现中找到。","source":"generated","evidence":["SKILL.md:5-7","scripts/list.py:42-68","scripts/list.py:89-124"]}
